    {
      "key": "afcbafea-c681-401b-82f0-36302d0a7125",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa-solid fa-bullseye-arrow\"></i> **Goal of this activity:**  Students connect today's sketch-then-build structure to real design practice before they see either level.\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-comments\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discuss:** *Before a programmer writes code, they often sketch a plan first. Why might that help?*\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discussion Goal:** Students surface ideas like catching problems early, deciding what a project needs before typing, or having something to check the finished code against."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "afcbafea-c681-401b-82f0-36302d0a7125",
        "lesson_activity.key": "1ffa1f2c-3ab2-4c0b-b7a6-feadedb6010d"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "20647ad3-2350-4877-bac2-ef8323aff5e5",
      "position": 2,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Do This:** Introduce the lesson objectives."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
