    {
      "key": "412a4a70-8e2c-48fd-a4ed-ecd85cae830a",
      "position": 3,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-comments\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discuss:** *What did you keep, change, or reject from the AI's code, and why?*\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discussion Goal:** Students reference a specific line or value (a color, a shape, a variable) rather than a general \"it worked\" or \"it didn't.\""
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "412a4a70-8e2c-48fd-a4ed-ecd85cae830a",
