      }
    },
    {
      "key": "af5e59c0-f177-496e-9e20-6d8c672389b5",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa-solid fa-bullseye-arrow\"></i> **Goal of this activity:** Students recall Day 2's warm-up prediction (combining a number and a string) and extend that same predicting habit to a new case — combining two strings — surfacing that + behaves differently depending on data type, without naming why yet.\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-comments\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discuss:** Click the animated slide to display the discussion prompts and reveal each line's output only after students share their predictions.\n- *What do you think line 1 will print?*\n- *What do you think line 2 will print?*\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discussion Goal:** Students notice **5 + 3** gives 8 (adds), but **\"5\" + \"3\"** gives \"53\" (joins) — same symbol, different result depending on the data type. Do not introduce the word \"concatenation\" here; let it stay an open notice heading into Predict & Run.",
        "tips": [
          {
            "type": "teachingTip",
            "markdown": "Resist revealing both console lines at once — even a few seconds of holding the answer back is what makes this a prediction rather than a readout. If time is short, a quick thumbs-up/thumbs-down vote on each guess before revealing keeps it fast without skipping the predict step."
          }
        ]
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "af5e59c0-f177-496e-9e20-6d8c672389b5",
        "lesson_activity.key": "0ed69a3f-721c-4f65-bb6b-31db7bdce281"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "4d17803b-3619-4191-aceb-550ecdf46a7c",
      "position": 2,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Do This:** Introduce the lesson objectives."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "4d17803b-3619-4191-aceb-550ecdf46a7c",
        "lesson_activity.key": "0ed69a3f-721c-4f65-bb6b-31db7bdce281"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "478bbe55-0df6-4771-96d7-183f3be1f7d1",
      "position": 3,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Do This:** Introduce the Question of the Day."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "478bbe55-0df6-4771-96d7-183f3be1f7d1",
        "lesson_activity.key": "0ed69a3f-721c-4f65-bb6b-31db7bdce281"
      }
