      }
    },
    {
      "key": "d0e026a2-cb23-44d6-aa0e-912dac88b4a4",
      "position": 17,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-comments\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discuss:** Click the animated slide to display the discussion prompts.\n- *What's one question you asked in your interview, and why did you think it would get a meaningful number?*\n- *Did the bias check change anything about your questions or your plan? What did you change, or why not?*\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discussion Goal:** Students explain the numeric reasoning behind a specific interview question, not just naming a topic, and give a concrete example of what they revised after the bias check, or a specific reason nothing needed to change, not just \"no.\""
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "d0e026a2-cb23-44d6-aa0e-912dac88b4a4",
        "lesson_activity.key": "176ede1c-03a5-4bf8-9e35-71f242194068"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "181050db-b394-4078-b8e0-00f0a3042ad0",
      "position": 18,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Do This:** Review the lesson objectives."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "181050db-b394-4078-b8e0-00f0a3042ad0",
        "lesson_activity.key": "176ede1c-03a5-4bf8-9e35-71f242194068"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "37cf3ee2-6ae2-4590-95e0-d38bb7068c32",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "duration": "5",
        "name": "Warm Up"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "37cf3ee2-6ae2-4590-95e0-d38bb7068c32",
        "lesson_activity.key": "2017c3e3-68a6-44e7-836f-b6b013de85cc"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "c4654d92-6925-45fe-9370-8510169c9667",
      "position": 2,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa-solid fa-bullseye-arrow\"></i> **Goal of this activity:** Students revisit their own Day 1 plan and predict why their planned calculation will matter before they've written any code.\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-comments\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discuss:** *Look back at your Level 1 plan. What's one calculation you planned, and why do you think it'll matter once it's real code?*\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-lightbulb-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> **Discussion Goal:** Students name a specific calculation from their own plan — not a generic answer — and say what it'll actually reveal or change once real numbers replace the plan. This primes them to build it with intention in Level 2, not just transcribe the plan mechanically."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "c4654d92-6925-45fe-9370-8510169c9667",
        "lesson_activity.key": "2017c3e3-68a6-44e7-836f-b6b013de85cc"
      }
    },
